      "description": "Inspiration Mobility Group is a Washington, D.C.-headquartered sustainable infrastructure platform that finances, owns, develops and operates commercial electric-vehicle fleets, charging systems and related energy assets across North America. Its operating businesses include Inspiration Fleet and Inspiration Energy. ArcLight Energy Partners Fund VII launched the platform in 2021 with an initial $200 million commitment; Macquarie Asset Management and Ferrovial supplied a further $215 million of capital that closed in May 2022. Current company and investor materials identify ArcLight, Macquarie and Ferrovial as continuing investors, while their exact ownership percentages and Macquarie and Ferrovial investment vehicles are not publicly disclosed. Select Electrada assets acquired in June 2026 were integrated into Inspiration Energy and are not counted as a separate PortCo. No Inspiration-specific sale or pending ownership transfer was identified through August 13, 2026.",
